  "notes": [
    "Nintendo JP accessory page «Nintendo Switch 2 Proコントローラーの主な仕様». Axis mapping as labelled: 縦105mm = height, 横148mm = width, 厚さ60.2mm = depth (the HTML breaks the line after 横148mm×; the quote is the text with the <br> removed). The page does not say whether projections are excluded: excludes_projections null. ボタン row: L/R stick (+ stick buttons), A/B/X/Y/L/R/ZL/ZR, GL/GR, ＋/－, 十字, HOME, キャプチャー, シンクロ, C → dpad 1, face_button 4 (A/B/X/Y), bumper 2 (L/R), trigger 2 (ZL/ZR), stick 2, button 6 (+, −, HOME, capture, sync, C), and GL/GR as rear_button 2: the page's parts diagram puts them on the back (「好きなボタンを自由に割り当てることができます」); rear_button is borrowed from the slab-handheld vocabulary because the controller contract has no back-paddle kind (FLAG for the coordinator). Ports: ヘッドホンマイク端子 (3.5mm 4-pole CTIA) = headphone_3_5; USB端子 row «USB Type-C® 端子» = usb_c (the USB quote is the row's second line because the first is split by a <sup>). wired=false (Bluetooth); cell_kind built_in (1070mAh, not user-removable). released not on the page (null). host_console from the page title."
